Boots and gloves can generally be gotten from the mine town
watch if your pet survives the long enough to return from mines
end so this is a redundant supply.  I like it but I wonder if it
conflicts with one of the design intents of gola reflected when
polypiling -

When polypiling the formation of a golem turns random items
of a material into some of the worst items of that material.
Iron items become chains.  Wooden items become two handed
quarterstaves.  Mineral items become worthless glass.  This
pattern would have a leather golem yield the worst leather item
type.  Leather armor has by far the worst AC to weight ratio of
any leather item type as as such is the worst item of leather.


